 configuration</p><div class=\"ec-library-card-copy\"><p class=\"ec-library-model\">JBPJ-074</p><h3><a class=\"bx-textlink\" href=\"/products/koala-shaped-silicone-wine-glass-charms/\">Koala Shaped Silicone Wine Glass Charms (BT-15)</a></h3><p class=\"ec-library-facts\">silicone</p><a class=\"ec-library-link\" href=\"/products/koala-shaped-silicone-wine-glass-charms/\">View Details & Customization</a></div></article><article class=\"ec-library-card\" data-model=\"JBPJ-075\"><a class=\"ec-library-image-link\" href=\"/products/black-white-cat-shaped-silicone-wine/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/jbpj-075-4a11f81cc5.webp\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware Black White Cat Shaped Silicone Wine Glass Charms (BT-06)\"></a><p class=\"buyer-image-note\">Model / artwork reference · approve final configuration</p><div class=\"ec-library-card-copy\"><p class=\"ec-library-model\">JBPJ-075</p><h3><a class=\"bx-textlink\" href=\"/products/black-white-cat-shaped-silicone-wine/\">Black White Cat Shaped Silicone Wine Glass Charms (BT-06)</a></h3><p class=\"ec-library-facts\">silicone</p><a class=\"ec-library-link\" href=\"/products/black-white-cat-shaped-silicone-wine/\">View Details & Customization</a></div></article></div><div class=\"bx-actions\"><a class=\"bx-button bx-button-secondary\" href=\"/products/\">Explore the Full Product Catalog →</a></div></section><section class=\"bx-section bx-tinted\"><div class=\"bx-wrap\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">HOW IT WORKS</p><h2>From requirements to an approved order.</h2></div></div><div class=\"bx-step-grid\"><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>01</span><h3>Define the brief</h3><p>Share use, quantity, artwork and destination.</p></article><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>02</span><h3>Agree the proposal</h3><p>Review model, configuration, cost and schedule.</p></article><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>03</span><h3>Approve the sample</h3><p>Identify the approved artwork and sample version.</p></article><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>04</span><h3>Produce & deliver</h3><p>Agree inspection, packing and delivery requirements.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"bx-section\"><div class=\"bx-wrap bx-qa\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">BUYER QUESTIONS</p><h2>Clear answers before the next step.</h2></div></div><details><summary>Can I enquire before choosing a model?</summary><p>Yes. Describe the intended use, quantity and arrival date; add a reference or drawing if available.</p></details><details><summary>What determines MOQ and lead time?</summary><p>The model, materials, design versions, decoration, packaging and tooling affect the proposal. Small batches from 10 pieces and fast sampling apply to eligible projects; confirm the conditions in your quote.</p></details><details><summary>What should my enquiry include?</summary><p>A model or product idea, quantity, artwork, pack contents, destination and required arrival date are a useful start.</p></details></div></section><div class=\"bx-wrap\"><section class=\"bx-brief-strip\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">YOUR NEXT STEP</p><h2>Let’s make your project specific.</h2><p>Share the model or idea, quantity, artwork, destination and arrival date. You can add files in the project enquiry.</p></div><a class=\"bx-button\" href=\"/contact/?models=Drinkware%20for%20Adult%20Tasting%20Events\">Request a Project Quote ↗</a></section></div></div>"},"/zh/tasting-events-drinkware/":{"title":"成人品鉴活动杯具 | BOOM Drinkware","description":"为成人活动协调饮用器皿、品鉴配件与分发方式。","html":"<div class=\"bx-site\"><section class=\"bx-business-hero\"><div class=\"bx-wrap bx-business-grid\"><div><nav class=\"bx-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a class=\"bx-textlink\" href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> / 成人品鉴活动杯具</nav><p class=\"bx-kicker\">应用场景 / 采购规划</p><h1>成人品鉴活动杯具</h1><p class=\"bx-lead\">为成人活动协调饮用器皿、品鉴配件与分发方式。</p><div class=\"bx-actions\"><a class=\"bx-button\" href=\"/zh/contact/?models=Drinkware%20for%20Adult%20Tasting%20Events\">提交项目询价 ↗</a><a class=\"bx-button bx-button-secondary\" href=\"/zh/products/\">浏览产品型号</a></div></div><figure class=\"bx-business-photo\"><img src=\"/occ-corporate.webp\" alt=\"成人品鉴活动杯具 — 视觉参考\" width=\"900\" height=\"600\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><figcaption>规划概念图 · 非实际客户订单或工厂实拍。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"bx-wrap bx-section\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">先看采购任务</p><h2>饮用容量、识别方式及活动布置</h2></div></div><div class=\"bx-two\"><article class=\"bx-panel\"><h3>这个项目先确认什么</h3><p>说明饮品、品鉴容量及收集容器，不同杯具承担不同任务。</p><ul><li>饮品或收礼对象，以及实际服务环境</li><li>各设计数量与套装实际组成</li><li>期望到货日期及目的地</li></ul></article><article class=\"bx-panel dark\"><h3>把想法变成可审核的需求</h3><p>先确定参考型号，再让图稿、样品确认与包装对应项目截止日期。</p><ul><li>明确图稿版本与审批人</li><li>根据实际用途审核样品</li><li>区分个人礼品与共用服务工具</li></ul></article></div></section><section class=\"bx-wrap bx-section\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">先看一组相关参考</p><h2>值得比较的型号参考。</h2></div><p>以下为选型建议，不代表已完成客户项目，下单前需核对具体型号。</p></div><div class=\"bx-model-grid\"><article class=\"ec-library-card\" data-model=\"HJB-001\"><a class=\"ec-library-image-link\" href=\"/zh/products/wholesale-plastic-stemless-wine-glass-12oz/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/hjb-001-33c595d11e.webp\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"定制12oz塑料无柄红酒杯（再生料 · 可叠 · BPA Free）\"></a><p class=\"buyer-image-note\">型号 / 图稿参考 · 最终配置按样品确认</p><div class=\"ec-library-card-copy\"><p class=\"ec-library-model\">HJB-001</p><h3><a class=\"bx-textlink\" href=\"/zh/products/wholesale-plastic-stemless-wine-glass-12oz/\">定制12oz塑料无柄红酒杯（再生料 · 可叠 · BPA Free）</a></h3><p class=\"ec-library-facts\">plastic · 12 oz / 2 oz</p><a class=\"ec-library-link\" href=\"/zh/products/wholesale-plastic-stemless-wine-glass-12oz/\">查看型号与定制</a></div></article><article class=\"ec-library-card\" data-model=\"HJB-002\"><a class=\"ec-library-image-link\" href=\"/zh/products/wholesale-plastic-stemless-wine-